      "answer": "The temporary field mappings planned in the MapleHarvest Quebec pilot router transform include mapping txn_id to transaction_id and total_amount to amount_cents, with type coercion from string to int, while preserving key fields such as store_id and register_id. This transform is to be implemented in the SI-CLOUD-ROUTER component and will add a transformation flag field _ns_transform=true and enable OR-AUDIT-LOGS for each transformed event for audit purposes [art_5a91258f4056].\n\nThe March 23 workshop is a Schema Signoff Workshop with attendees including Sophie Tremblay, Marc Gauthier, Ellen Park, Platform engineers, and Northstar SE/Ing teams. The workshop's agenda is to agree on a canonical schema for payment, register_events, and sensor_thermo data; define alias mapping; and establish a producer migration plan. The deliverable from this workshop is a signed schema document to be uploaded to SI-SCHEMA-REG and a change control ticket with producer migration milestones [art_5a91258f4056].",
